FROM node:20-alpine
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm install
COPY . .

# --host 0.0.0.0 required — Vite defaults to binding localhost inside the
# container, which is unreachable from outside it (from nginx, in this
# setup). Internal only — expose, no ports:.
EXPOSE 5173
CMD ["npm", "run", "dev", "--", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "5173"]
```

### Empty folder skeleton (per §1A) — `.gitkeep` placeholders

Git doesn't track empty directories, so each of these gets a placeholder. Real files land here in later phases per the roadmap.

